  "name": "review: no-MR nag advises re-running review, which the state machine rejects; no way to attach an MR while in review",
  "slug": "review-no-mr-nag-advises",
  "spec": {
    "summary": "review: no-MR nag advises re-running review, which the state machine rejects; no way to attach an MR while in review",
    "details_md": "review.ts:114-121 nag says re-run slop review once the MR exists, but checkReviewEntry rejects review->review (exit 6). update has no --mr flag, so the only routes to attach a late MR are a spurious start re-entry or a hand-edit. Fix: allow updating the MR link on a review-state ticket (e.g. slop review --mr on same state updates the link, or update --mr).",
    "acceptance": [
      "a review-state ticket can get/replace its MR link non-interactively",
      "nag text matches what the CLI actually allows"
    ],
    "context": [
      "src/cli/commands/review.ts:114",
      "src/tickets/state.ts:291"
    ],
